cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SiberKapan: Open-Source Threat Intelligence Platform for Turkish Infrastructure"
authors:
  - family-names: "Alver"
    given-names: "Oktay"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OktayAlver/siberkapan"
url: "https://siberkapan.org"
abstract: "SiberKapan is an open-source threat intelligence platform that collects, validates, and shares indicators of compromise from a self-operated honeypot network, FortiGate integrations, and nginx log monitoring, with a focus on threats targeting Turkish infrastructure. SiberKapan is an official MISP default feed provider."
keywords:
  - threat intelligence
  - cyber threat intelligence
  - honeypot
  - MISP
  - cybersecurity
  - Turkey
license: MIT
